{"id":"von","lemma":"вон","pos":"adv","rank":313,"glosses":["there","off, out (away), outside, away"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты знаешь вон тех людей?","en":"Do you know those people over there?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"}]},{"text":"«Где твой дом?» – «Вон там».","en":"\"Where is your house?\" \"It is over there.\"","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"house, building"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Моя машина вон там.","en":"My car's over there.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"car, motor vehicle"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Я буду ждать вон там.","en":"I'll be waiting over there.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to wait for"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Кто этот человек вон там?","en":"Who's that fellow over there?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"person"},null,{"g":"there"}]}]}